      <title>London's Housing Crisis Is About to Get Real</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-23/london-s-housing-crisis-is-about-to-get-real</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">65e06307ba514b6d946c58bb</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 04:00:10 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Steel yourself: We haven’t begun to feel the pain from London’s housing crisis. Homebuilding slowed to a crawl more than a year ago, so the idea that the real trouble hasn’t yet arrived is a sobering thought. Supply is on the brink of an “extraordinary collapse” that will start next year and extend through 2029, according to developer Ballymore Group.</description>
