      <description>How risible and despicable: In addressing the United Nations General Assembly, Donald Trump once again bragged that “while others have spoken of peace, I have made peace.” Then he rattled off the “eight” wars he has supposedly settled, before boasting about the war he waged and won against Venezuela and defending the war he is waging, but seems unable to win, against Iran, even musing about whether to “annihilate” it.</description>
